R-TF10 R-TF8 R-EC19 (slice 236, Design Q607, Q610): `tln tool update talon` is the fix that the gate message names, so a `talon.toml` with a range that this tln is outside of (`>=999.0.0`, in the directory of the run) must not stop it. The case is `tool/th3-self-update-bad-config` with that file added. The expected output is the output of th3. The command reads no `talon.toml` today, so the case is green and guards that this stays so. Question Q1 of the slice file: the design says "each command that reads talon.toml", and `tool update talon` is not one of them.
